      "title": "Working now (Nov 2026)",
      "items": [
        "Teleop over cmd_vel with a 0.25 s timeout in the bridge and a 300 ms watchdog on the R4",
        "IMU 20 Hz, battery, pan servo, diagnostics; URDF + TF; Foxglove layout",
        "Camera 30 FPS; YOLO26n person detection ~19 FPS on the CPU; pan tracking"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Two compute parts (ADR-0006)",
      "items": [
        "Every ROS node runs on the Pi 5; the UNO R4 holds no robot logic",
        "The R4 speaks the plain-text serial-r4-v1 protocol: motor PWM, servo, MPU-6050, battery, watchdog",
        "No ESP32, no micro-ROS (superseded ADR-0002)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Odometry without wheel encoders",
      "items": [
        "The TT motors have no encoders and skid-steer wheels slide when turning",
        "rf2o matches consecutive LiDAR scans; the EKF fuses that with the R4 gyro",
        "slam_toolbox maps on the fused odometry; Nav2 plans on the map"
      ]
    },
